# cloud-session-projects - which project a cloud session's transcript is
# filed under, by the repository the session worked in. Copy this file to
# cloud-session-projects (beside it) and edit; fetch-cloud-conversations reads
# that copy. One line per repository: its name as GitHub shows it, then the
# project folder on this computer. "~" means your home folder. Sessions with
# no repository named here go to CLOUD_TRANSCRIPT_PROJECT (your home folder,
# whose transcripts land in ~/ai/llm-transcripts).
#
# repository        project folder
ai-stuff            /mnt/mtwo/programming/ai-stuff
r-mail              /mnt/mtwo/programming/r-mail
rao-chat            /mnt/mtwo/programming/rao-chat
wow-chat-2026       /mnt/mtwo/programming/wow-chat-2026
